     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-london/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par6/separator_copy_copy__354705007"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Midday</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-london/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london/lh_app_london_borough-market_shutterstock2371106127_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Culinary meeting place for gourmets: the Borough Market"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Indulge Yourself at Borough Market</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>I have a great lunch at Borough Market, a gourmet paradise with a long history: food has been traded here since 1756</li><li>From gourmet meals with champagne and oysters to local favorites like fish and chips, there’s something for every taste and budget</li><li>Note: the market is closed on Mondays</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Borough Market",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Stroll Through Hyde Park&nbsp;</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Originally established in the 16th century as a royal hunting ground, Hyde Park is now an idyllic oasis in the heart of London</li><li>My favorite thing to do? Rent a bike or take a boat ride on the Serpentine Lake</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-london/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par12/separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-london/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par13/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london/lh_app_london_soho_alamyW8TF01_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Backyard in Soho with colorful flowerpots and pink-painted store"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Shop in Soho</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>The district’s unique and colorful shops make it an exciting and lively place to explore</li><li>The trendy vintage labels in the small boutiques, and the traditional department store Liberty are an absolute must for me as a shopping fan</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Regent St., Carnaby St&nbsp;",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-london/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par17/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london/lh_app_london_westend-theatre_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Stage scene from the musical 'Les Misérables'"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Experience Vietnamese&nbsp;Cuisine at Pho</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>This restaurant has multiple locations across London and serves delicious soups, summer rolls, salads, and rice dishes</li><li>Many dishes are vegan friendly&nbsp;</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "163-165 Wardour St&nbsp;",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Watch a Musical in the West End</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>I love musicals, which is why I'm drawn to the West End in the evenings. Popular productions include \"The Phantom of the Opera\" at His Majesty’s Theatre and \"Les Misérables\" at the Sondheim Theatre</li><li>My tip: buy evening tickets on the same day at a box office like those at Piccadilly Circus or Oxford Circus. They’re much cheaper there!</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Copyrights: Westend61, Shutterstock, Alamy, Johan Persson",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_23"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>About</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_24"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Since 2023, Stefanie Sauer has been the owned media marketing manager at Lufthansa. She studied in London and Oxford and her passion for England, especially her favorite city, London, continues to draw her back to the island several times a year.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-london_paragraph_25"
     }
    ],
